From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:00:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: organize the space tree

Spaces collapse to a status summary, list plain terminals dimmed (hideable per space), show where a pane works when it differs from its space and how long each agent has been in its state. Lines drag onto another space to move the pane or within a space to reorder tabs, and their right-click menu renames, moves or closes. next_agent/previous_agent cycle the agents needing input first, and focus_agent numbers agents in tree order.

